Driving through the streets of Tokyo with the 992 GT3 RS. 🇯🇵 

@targa.28 gave me a chance to capture some moments with his one of a kind Palladium Metallic spec. 

Shot by myself and @julianstollmeier 

@porsche_japan @porsche

Earlier this year I had the crazy idea to host my first creator grouptrip. The concept was simple : create the trip I would have dreamed to have when I got into travel filmmaking. 

Choosing the destination was the easy part. The island of Siargao, Philippines seemed like a no brainer. One of my favourite places in the world. A true paradise island filled with beautiful spots to shoot, kind locals & amazing surf.

Finding the right people to join the trip was the real challenge. After months of calls, doubts and pumping out content everyday, we ended up selling out this first trip with 10 creators from every corner of the globe.

Everyone with very different backgrounds but the same burning passion for travel & filmmaking. Couldn’t be happier with how everything turned out. 

The group clicked from day 1, everyone was having the best time. What really made me happy was to see the real impact this trip had on each and one of them individually. 

Being surrounded by the right people really is everything. This is the main reason why I got to where I am now in my career and I wanted to help other people get to live that too.

So if this can be a reminder for anyone reading this. Go out there and find your people. I promise you, your life will change.

